  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups vegetable broth, divided",
    "0.5 cup dry lentils",
    "0.25 cup pearl barley",
    "1 teaspoon yeast extract spread, e.g. Marmite/Vegemite",
    "1 large carrot, diced",
    "0.5 onion, finely chopped",
    "0.5 cup walnuts, coarsely chopped",
    "3 potatoes, chopped",
    "1 teaspoon all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 teaspoon water",
    "salt and pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9U7UidPCERtRu3p7suVbgiBZJn0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24717-vegetarian-shepherds-pie-ii-VAT-step-01-72f0b7ec2f8a415db27364023b04300e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24717/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine 1 ¼ cups broth, lentils, barley, and yeast extract in a large saucepan over medium-low heat; simmer for 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/s68MgyFX1MljisNx_IeUU75UYB4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24717-vegetarian-shepherds-pie-ii-VAT-step-02-01-190fdf3256f5477fb4bcec57b74d991e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24717/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, combine remaining 3/4 cup broth, carrot, onion, and walnuts in a medium saucepan over medium heat; cook until tender, about 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/swzS2pVeAZklGTHhA4K33viT6-I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24717-vegetarian-shepherds-pie-ii-VAT-step-03-15c46e5c19954be7a89acb54e28b2449.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24717/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, place potatoes in a large pot and cover with salted water; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer until tender but still firm, about 15 minutes. Drain and mash.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fWuKeg8yoVZVCb1KSi1ePvLeL5Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24717-vegetarian-shepherds-pie-ii-VAT-step-04-2a219c8192f84ed18777e89d9bdecd6a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24717/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour and water in a small bowl; stir into carrot mixture and simmer until thickened. Combine carrot and lentil mixtures; season with salt and black pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/devOlOLi296Oqoq-PrpMr4u0cts=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24717-vegetarian-shepherds-pie-ii-VAT-step-05-b03ca90a15ca48cd8d9b87bfc33940c0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24717/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer carrot-lentil mixture to a 2-quart casserole dish; spoon mashed potatoes over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6Ebv0yWBwoC6qxCNijhvLHu5zcM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24717-vegetarian-shepherds-pie-ii-VAT-step-06-01-76e5363a950245198772902af34b40f1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24717/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until lightly browned on top, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7g07wIzvHTKepqirl3Ttu7kUA2g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24717-vegetarian-shepherds-pie-ii-VAT-step-07-06bfa112e2254f3384cd16cf276fb540.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24717/step_07.webp"
    }
